WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:02.001
-Well everyone's talking.

00:00:02.001 --> 00:00:03.636
Tomorrow night is
the vice-presidential debate

00:00:03.636 --> 00:00:05.405
between Mike Pence
and Kamala Harris,

00:00:05.405 --> 00:00:07.106
and both candidates
are getting ready.

00:00:07.106 --> 00:00:09.642
And get this --
we managed to get our hands

00:00:09.642 --> 00:00:12.244
on some footage
of Vice President Pence

00:00:12.244 --> 00:00:14.080
preparing for the debate.

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:16.682
Take a look at this.

00:00:16.682 --> 00:00:19.051
-All righty. Let's get started.

00:00:19.051 --> 00:00:21.121
The vice-presidential debate
is tomorrow night,

00:00:21.121 --> 00:00:23.990
and the entire world
will be half-watching.

00:00:23.990 --> 00:00:26.358
We're talking
Kamala versus Pence,

00:00:26.358 --> 00:00:28.461
David versus Goliath,

00:00:28.461 --> 00:00:29.862
the cool girl in school

00:00:29.862 --> 00:00:32.565
versus the heroic reverend
from "Footloose."

00:00:32.565 --> 00:00:35.201
So let's prep.
Short for "prepare."

00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:37.303
Short for "prepare thyselves.

00:00:37.303 --> 00:00:39.639
A woman has entered
the mess hall."

00:00:39.639 --> 00:00:42.342
-You ready to go, sir?
-I am.

00:00:42.342 --> 00:00:43.743
This will be the most fun
I've had

00:00:43.743 --> 00:00:46.646
since Mother and I visited
that grain silo.

00:00:46.646 --> 00:00:47.947
-First question.

00:00:47.947 --> 00:00:50.349
Between COVID in the White House
and the climate crisis

00:00:50.349 --> 00:00:52.051
taking its toll on the nation,

00:00:52.051 --> 00:00:54.954
what's the biggest threat
facing America today?

00:00:54.954 --> 00:00:56.556
-Well, that's easy.

00:00:56.556 --> 00:00:59.058
Rock-'n'-roll music
is a Satan-level threat

00:00:59.058 --> 00:01:01.760
conjured by the dark power
of female magic.

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:04.363
That's why I'm doing everything
in my power to bring

00:01:04.363 --> 00:01:07.733
barnyard nursery rhymes
back into the mainstream.

00:01:07.733 --> 00:01:09.202
Next question.

00:01:09.202 --> 00:01:12.271
-Mr. Vice President, did you
take on any presidential duties

00:01:12.271 --> 00:01:14.907
while Mr. Trump was recovering
in Walter Reed?

00:01:14.907 --> 00:01:16.276
-Why, yes.

00:01:16.276 --> 00:01:18.411
I took on several more roles
in the White House,

00:01:18.411 --> 00:01:21.915
including milk tester
and haunted portrait.

00:01:26.219 --> 00:01:28.921
Next.
-Mr. Vice President,

00:01:28.921 --> 00:01:31.157
is the American dream
alive and well?

00:01:31.157 --> 00:01:33.793
-Well, of course, it is,
and I'm proof of it.

00:01:33.793 --> 00:01:36.229
My father was
a gas-station attendant.

00:01:36.229 --> 00:01:38.531
And his father,
a slice of white bread

00:01:38.531 --> 00:01:40.666
that made a wish upon a star.

00:01:40.666 --> 00:01:42.301
The recent economic downturn?

00:01:42.301 --> 00:01:45.505
Well, that's just God punishing
us for "Animal Crossing."

00:01:45.505 --> 00:01:48.208
It's not natural.
Foxes shouldn't talk.

00:01:48.208 --> 00:01:49.842
-What do you say to young people

00:01:49.842 --> 00:01:53.245
who think Kamala Harris
speaks for the disenfranchised?

00:01:53.245 --> 00:01:54.781
-I say baloney.

00:01:54.781 --> 00:01:57.150
The most disenfranchised people
in this country

00:01:57.150 --> 00:02:00.053
are folks like me --
old white men who believe

00:02:00.053 --> 00:02:02.154
open-mouth kisses
are a Chinese plot

00:02:02.154 --> 00:02:03.723
to destroy the government.

00:02:03.723 --> 00:02:07.126
Besides, I too have been
connecting with Generation Z,

00:02:07.126 --> 00:02:08.962
and I've even tried
this new food all the kids

00:02:08.962 --> 00:02:12.432
are obsessed with
called creamed cheese.

00:02:12.432 --> 00:02:14.333
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.333 --> 00:02:17.603
-Sir, President Trump
attacked Joe Biden's family.

00:02:17.603 --> 00:02:19.772
Would you do the same
to your opponent tonight?

00:02:19.772 --> 00:02:23.075
-Look, I prefer
to keep things civil,

00:02:23.075 --> 00:02:25.110
but I swear to Him...

00:02:25.110 --> 00:02:26.945
if Kamala makes
any snide remarks

00:02:26.945 --> 00:02:29.849
about how Mother has to burp me
when I eat salted chips,

00:02:29.849 --> 00:02:32.384
the gloves are coming off.

00:02:32.384 --> 00:02:34.319
-Sir, do you support
the Senate healthcare bill

00:02:34.319 --> 00:02:37.090
that would protect people
with pre-existing conditions?

00:02:37.090 --> 00:02:41.194
-I do. In fact, I have a lot of
pre-existing conditions myself,

00:02:41.194 --> 00:02:45.331
including a tap-water allergy,
pajama rash,

00:02:45.331 --> 00:02:47.232
and migraines I get
whenever I see a dog

00:02:47.232 --> 00:02:49.202
that's not fully clothed.

00:02:49.202 --> 00:02:50.836
Next question. Matthew?

00:02:50.836 --> 00:02:53.839
-Oh. Sir, just pretend
I'm Susan Page.

00:02:53.839 --> 00:02:56.275
-Who?
-That's the moderator.

00:02:56.275 --> 00:03:00.646
-Well, I'll probably just
address her chaperone, but okay.

00:03:00.646 --> 00:03:02.681
-Mr. Vice President,
a lot of people are saying

00:03:02.681 --> 00:03:05.051
that Kamala is just
a more dynamic candidate

00:03:05.051 --> 00:03:06.152
than you are.

00:03:06.152 --> 00:03:07.987
What do you say to that?

00:03:07.987 --> 00:03:10.789
-I say that's why I'm debuting
my new catch phrase.

00:03:10.789 --> 00:03:13.559
After I make a good point,
I'm going to say,

00:03:13.559 --> 00:03:15.962
"Now, that's a spicy soda pop."

00:03:15.962 --> 00:03:18.330
-Jesus Christ.
-Is he here?

00:03:18.330 --> 00:03:19.965
-Sir, here's a question.

00:03:19.965 --> 00:03:22.302
Will you step down from
the vice presidency...

00:03:22.302 --> 00:03:24.737
-Yes!
-...if you lose the election?

00:03:24.737 --> 00:03:26.906
-Sir, please come back.

